--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- two chains meeting at a shared Connect point (weighted), dynamic run
-- A heavy internal Connect point is suspended between two elevated fixed attachments by two chain
-- legs -- a symmetric crowfoot / weight-on-two-cables. The Connect point position is a force-balanced
-- unknown carrying Mass (50 t) + Vol; both legs settle to equal tension. Connect/Free points require
-- a dynamic deck (dtM/TMax); the at-rest static IC seeds the gen-alpha march, held here for 2 s.
-- Chain: R4 studless 155 mm, volume-equivalent diam 0.2791 m, dry mass 480.93 kg/m, EA 2.058e9 N.
